# The Vercel deploy is the Next.js web app only. Everything below is a sibling
# product that ships through its own pipeline and has no part in the web build —
# without this file the CLI archived ~3.5GB (1.3GB compressed) and the upload
# failed with a bare "fetch failed" (2026-08-10).
#
# overlay-host — Electron in-game overlay, carries its own node_modules (~1.9GB)
# desktop      — C# WPF desktop app + build artifacts (~191MB)
# _research    — scratch research notes, never served
overlay-host
desktop
_research

